# Normalize line endings for everyone regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Avoids phantom "modified" files and flaky formatter results caused by
# CRLF/LF mismatches between checkouts. v1.4.0 committed CRLF into 84 files
# because this file only covered *.sh/Makefile*/*.go — see CHANGELOG v1.4.1.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Makefile* text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
